comprehensive-content-analysis.template:
TASK: Analyze the following educational content to identify the subject and extract key concepts for quiz generation.

CONTENT:
{content}

PERFORM THE FOLLOWING ANALYSES:

1. SUBJECT DETECTION
   - Identify the Primary Subject (Math, Science, History/Social Studies, Language Arts, Computer Science, etc.)
   - Identify specific Sub-disciplines (e.g., Algebra, Biology, Civics)
   - Recommend the best question generation prompt

2. CONTENT EXTRACTION
   - Extract Main Topics (At least 3 broad themes)
   - Extract Key Concepts (At least 5 specific ideas)
   - Extract Critical Facts (At least 5 testable data, dates, definitions)
   - Define Learning Objectives (At least 3 objectives)

OUTPUT FORMAT (JSON):
{
  "subjectDetection": {
    "primarySubject": "mathematics|science|history|language|social_studies|computer_science|general",
    "subDisciplines": ["algebra", "geometry"],
    "confidence": 0.95,
    "recommendedPrompt": "math-question-generation"
  },
  "extractedConcepts": {
    "mainTopics": ["topic1", "topic2", "topic3"],
    "keyConcepts": [
      {
        "name": "concept name",
        "description": "brief explanation",
        "difficulty": "easy|medium|hard",
        "testable": true
      }
    ],
    "criticalFacts": [
      {
        "fact": "fact statement",
        "category": "definition|date|process",
        "importance": "high"
      }
    ],
    "learningObjectives": ["Students will..."]
  }
}

Return ONLY valid JSON, no additional text.
